<p class=GENELKURUL style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>Dan&#305;&#351;ma Kurulunun bir önerisi vard&#305;r,
okutup oylar&#305;n&#305;za sunaca&#287;&#305;m. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=GENELKURUL style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>Okutuyorum:<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:3.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:4.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:38.0pt;
mso-hyphenate:none;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>VIII.- ÖNER&#304;LER (Devam)<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:3.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:4.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:38.0pt;
mso-hyphenate:none;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>B) Dan&#305;&#351;ma Kurulu Önerileri<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:3.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:4.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:38.0pt;
mso-hyphenate:none;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>1.- Dan&#305;&#351;ma Kurulunun, Genel Kurulun 8
Ekim 2020 Per&#351;embe günü toplanmamas&#305; önerisinin Genel Kurulun
onay&#305;na sunulmas&#305;na ili&#351;kin önerisi <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=GENELKURUL align=right style='text-align:right;line-height:normal'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>7/10/2020<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=GENELKURUL align=center style='text-align:center;line-height:normal'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>Dan&#305;&#351;ma Kurulu
Önerisi<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=GENELKURUL style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>Dan&#305;&#351;ma Kurulunun 7/10/2020 Çar&#351;amba
günü (bugün) yapt&#305;&#287;&#305; toplant&#305;da, Genel Kurulun 8 Ekim 2020
Per&#351;embe günü toplanmamas&#305; önerisinin Genel Kurulun onay&#305;na
sunulmas&#305; uygun görülmü&#351;tür.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3LMZA style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'><span
style='mso-tab-count:3'>                                                                                                       </span>Mustafa
&#350;entop<o:p></o:p></span></p>

